    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a really interesting take on the market signals. But I feel like you're kind of skipping over the part about the actual laws and mandates. Even if there's market volatility, wouldn't the sheer amount of compliance costs and legal red tape also be a massive factor? It seems like for a lot of founders, the government hurdles are just as big of a headache as the crypto stuff.",
